    requirement 'SR-020' : SecurityRequirement {
        doc /* The FC shall run with the GNSS spoofing and jamming checks enabled (EKF2_GPS_CHECK bits 9 and 11 set). */
        comment rationale /* PX4 always alerts on receiver-reported spoofing and jamming. With these bits set, a report also fails PX4's GNSS checks on the ground and in flight, so the EKF stops relying on that data and arming is blocked. The default (2047) leaves bit 11 clear. Detection depends on the receiver reporting the condition. */
